 d explore Buddhist wisdom in the context of the modern world. This week\, 
 the morning will be led by Kusalasara\, women's mitra convenor at the LBC.
  Her having recently returned from supporting a 3-month Ordination retreat
  in the Spanish mountains and her skill for communicating the Dharma in an
  engaging and accessible way should make this an energising and inspiring 
 session.
