BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poetry Night: When I Met My Muse
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260801T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260801T213000
UID:b6a60addbbae97e7777e9c99@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:What is a muse? How do we recognise one? What have muses got t
 o do with writing? Have you met yours? What are their terms and conditions
 ? Come and find out more! Join Dharmavadana\, Sraddhamalini and Vishvantar
 a for an interactive evening of muse-invocation\, poetry & conversation\, 
 plus the launch of Dharmavadana's new poetry pamphlet "Birdmen & Astronaut
 s"\, published by Poetry Salzburg.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/poetry-night-when-i-met-
 my-muse
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dharma Day Festival
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260802T093000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260802T213000
UID:2a78664aad05caa0e780cdbf@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Two-and-a-half millennia ago\, the Buddha laid out a practical
  path to a new kind of consciousness. On Dharma Day\, we will come togethe
 r to celebrate the anniversary of the Buddha first communicating his Dharm
 a (‘teachings’) to others after his Enlightenment\, sparking off a lin
 eage of teachers and disciples that has transformed many lives\, and conti
 nues today with us.\nThere will be meditation\, talks and a special ritual
  in the evening. All are welcome.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/dharma-day-festival-02-a
 ug-2026
END:VEVENT
